  "narrative": "<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Short impact summary</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Protagonists of War (2021), published by Leuven University Press, has no recorded citations yet, but it has been downloaded 2,470 times.</p>\n<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Full narrative</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Protagonists of War by Raymond Fagel was published by Leuven University Press in 2021. Conceptually, the work connects to Narrative, Reading (process), Poetry, Literature and Key (lock).</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">OpenAlex records no citations for the book so far.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">It has been downloaded 2,470 times via OAPEN. The work was funded by NWO Free competition.</p>",
